#: kcmlocale.cpp:403
msgid ""
"This is where you live. KDE will use the defaults for this country or region."
msgstr "Üz yäşägän urını bu. KDE bu il/ölkä öçen töpcaylarnı qullanaçaq."

#: kcmlocale.cpp:406
msgid ""
"This will add a language to the list. If the language is already in the list, "
"the old one will be moved instead."
msgstr ""
"Bu tezemgä tel östär. Tel artıq tezemdä bulğan bulsa, yañası iskeneñ östenä "
"yazılır."

#: kcmlocale.cpp:410
msgid "This will remove the highlighted language from the list."
msgstr "Yaqtırtılğan tel tezemnän atılır."

#: kcmlocale.cpp:413
msgid ""
"KDE programs will be displayed in the first available language in this list.\n"
"If none of the languages are available, US English will be used."
msgstr ""
"KDE yazılımnarı tezemneñ östendäge berençe teldä kürsäteler. Tezemdä ber tel dä "
"bulmasa, Amerikan İngliz tele qullanılır."

#: kcmlocale.cpp:420
msgid ""
"Here you can choose your country or region. The settings for languages, numbers "
"etc. will automatically switch to the corresponding values."
msgstr ""
"Monda il yä ki ölkäñne saylí alasıñ. Tellär, sannar h.b. köylämäläre üzläre "
"bäyläneşle itep almaşınaçaq."

#: kcmlocale.cpp:427
msgid ""
"Here you can choose the languages that will be used by KDE. If the first "
"language in the list is not available, the second will be used, etc. If only US "
"English is available, no translations have been installed. You can get "
"translation packages for many languages from the place you got KDE from."
"<p>Note that some applications may not be translated to your languages; in this "
"case, they will automatically fall back to US English."
msgstr ""
"Monda KDE qullanaçaq tellärne saylarğa bula. Tezemdäge berençe telneñ qullanuı "
"mömkin bulmasa, ikençe tel qullanılır. İnglizçä genä qullanırlıq bulsa, dimäk "
"tärcemä quyılmağan äle. Tärcemä faylların KDE alğan cireñnän ala alasıñ."
"<p>Qayber aşırmalarnıñ sineñ telgä tärcemä itelüläre mömkin bulmaw säbäple "
"alarnıñ Amerikan İngliz telendä kürsäteläçägen istä tot."

